<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal levy on intra-group loans not retroactive.</title>
<headline>Portugal levy on intra-group loans not retroactive.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new stamp duty on loans extended by holding companies to firms within the group, which is being introduced in the 1997 budget, will not be retroactive, Finance Minister Antonio Sousa Franco said.</p>
<p>The government had intended that the measure cover lending in the past five years.</p>
<p>Sousa Franco said that the duty would also not be levied on loans of less than 180 days.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
